<title>USA: Trans Leasing says names interim CEO.</title>
<headline>Trans Leasing says names interim CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trans Leasing International Inc said Larry Grossman was elected chairman of the board and named interim chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The equipment leasing company said a search for a permanent chief executive is under way.</p>
<p>Former company chairman, chief executive and president Richard Grossman, 44, died October 7 from injuries sustained on October 3.</p>
<p>Shares in Trans Leasing closed on Monday off 1/8 to 4-1/2.  </p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
